OL,3,GNEWSAMan who raped woman and sexually
OL,4,Aassaulted boys jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who subjected a woman and three
OL,7,Fyoung boys to a 10-year campaign of
OL,8,Frape and sexual assault has been jailed
OL,9,Funder a lifelong restriction order.
OL,11,FChristopher Rodger physically and
OL,12,Fsexually attacked the woman at
OL,13,Faddresses in Dumfries and Galloway and
OL,14,Fassaulted an eight-year-old boy during
OL,15,Fthe same period.
OL,17,FThe 42-year-old also performed a sex
OL,18,Fattack on an 11-year-old and sexually
OL,19,Fassaulted another over a 12-month
OL,20,Fperiod.
