OL,3,GNEWSAMan who raped woman and sexually
OL,4,Aassaulted boys jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FRodger, from Balerno in Edinburgh,
OL,7,Fdenied rape and physical and sexual
OL,8,Fassault charges during a trial at the
OL,9,Fcity's High Court, but was told he must
OL,10,Fserve at least seven-and-a-half years
OL,11,Fbefore he would be considered for
OL,12,Frelease from jail.
